  "date": "2026-10-31",
  "level": "B1",
  "title": "Small Habits, Steady Progress",
  "topic": "學習方法",
  "sources": [],
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "When people want to learn something new, ",
        "zh": "當人們想學新事物時，"
      },
      {
        "en": "they often make a big plan. ",
        "zh": "往往會訂一個大計畫。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They promise to study for two hours every evening ",
        "zh": "他們承諾每晚學習兩小時，"
      },
      {
        "en": "or finish a difficult book in a week. ",
        "zh": "或一週內讀完一本難書。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At first, the plan feels exciting. ",
        "zh": "起初，這個計畫讓人興奮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "But after a busy day, ",
        "zh": "但忙碌一天之後，"
      },
      {
        "en": "it can be hard to begin. ",
        "zh": "可能很難開始。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A smaller plan may be easier to keep.",
        "zh": "小一點的計畫也許更容易持續。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Think about reading English. ",
        "zh": "想想閱讀英文這件事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "You do not need to understand every word ",
        "zh": "你不必理解每個單字，"
      },
      {
        "en": "before you can enjoy an article. ",
        "zh": "也能享受一篇文章。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Start with a short text ",
        "zh": "先從一篇短文開始，"
      },
      {
        "en": "about a topic that interests you. ",
        "zh": "主題選你感興趣的。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Read it once to find the main idea. ",
        "zh": "讀一遍，找出主要意思。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then read it again more slowly. ",
        "zh": "接著再慢慢讀一遍。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This gives each reading a clear purpose.",
        "zh": "這讓每次閱讀都有明確的目的。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "When you find an unfamiliar word, ",
        "zh": "當你遇到不熟悉的單字時，"
      },
      {
        "en": "look at the words around it. ",
        "zh": "看看它周圍的詞。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Try to guess the meaning ",
        "zh": "試著猜測意思，"
      },
      {
        "en": "before checking the translation. ",
        "zh": "再查看翻譯。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Your guess does not have to be perfect. ",
        "zh": "你的猜測不必完美。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The important step is to think ",
        "zh": "重要的一步是思考，"
      },
      {
        "en": "about how the word works in that sentence. ",
        "zh": "這個字在那個句子中如何使用。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A useful example can help you remember it.",
        "zh": "一個實用的例子能幫助你記住它。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Choose only a few words ",
        "zh": "只選幾個單字，"
      },
      {
        "en": "to add to your word cards. ",
        "zh": "加入你的單字卡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "If you save every new word, ",
        "zh": "如果每個新字都收藏，"
      },
      {
        "en": "your review list may soon become too long. ",
        "zh": "複習清單可能很快變得太長。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Choose words that you expect to meet again ",
        "zh": "選擇你預期會再次遇到的字，"
      },
      {
        "en": "or use in your own life. ",
        "zh": "或在自己生活中會用到的字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Keep the original sentence ",
        "zh": "保留原本的句子，"
      },
      {
        "en": "so the card has a real context.",
        "zh": "讓單字卡具有真實的語境。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Listening can be part of the same habit. ",
        "zh": "聆聽也能成為同一個習慣的一部分。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Play one paragraph while following the text. ",
        "zh": "播放一段，同時跟著文字閱讀。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Notice where the speaker pauses ",
        "zh": "注意朗讀者在哪裡停頓，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and which words sound stronger. ",
        "zh": "以及哪些字聽起來較重。"
      },
      {
        "en": "You can lower the speed ",
        "zh": "你可以調慢速度，"
      },
      {
        "en": "if the voice is too fast. ",
        "zh": "如果朗讀太快的話。"
      },
      {
        "en": "After that, listen without looking. ",
        "zh": "之後，不看文字再聽一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "You may notice something different each time.",
        "zh": "每次你都可能注意到不同的地方。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Make your practice easy to start. ",
        "zh": "讓練習容易開始。"
      },
      {
        "en": "You might read after breakfast ",
        "zh": "你可以在早餐後閱讀，"
      },
      {
        "en": "or listen while taking a quiet break. ",
        "zh": "或在安靜休息時聆聽。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A familiar time or place ",
        "zh": "熟悉的時間或地點，"
      },
      {
        "en": "can remind you to begin. ",
        "zh": "能提醒你開始。"
      },
      {
        "en": "If you miss a day, ",
        "zh": "如果漏了一天，"
      },
      {
        "en": "return to the habit the next day. ",
        "zh": "隔天就回到這個習慣。"
      },
      {
        "en": "You do not need to punish yourself ",
        "zh": "你不必責備自己，"
      },
      {
        "en": "or prepare a much bigger lesson.",
        "zh": "也不必準備大得多的課程。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "You can make your own example ",
        "zh": "你可以自創一個例句，"
      },
      {
        "en": "with a new word. ",
        "zh": "使用新學的單字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Think about a familiar place ",
        "zh": "想想一個熟悉的地方，"
      },
      {
        "en": "or a person in your life. ",
        "zh": "或生活中的某個人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Say the sentence slowly, ",
        "zh": "慢慢說出這個句子，"
      },
      {
        "en": "then listen to it again. ",
        "zh": "然後再聽一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "If it feels difficult, ",
        "zh": "如果覺得困難，"
      },
      {
        "en": "make it shorter. ",
        "zh": "就把句子縮短。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The purpose is not to sound perfect. ",
        "zh": "目的不是聽起來完美，"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is to use what you learned ",
        "zh": "而是運用你學到的內容，"
      },
      {
        "en": "in a way that means something to you.",
        "zh": "用一種對你有意義的方式。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "At the end of the week, ",
        "zh": "一週結束時，"
      },
      {
        "en": "look back at what you have learned. ",
        "zh": "回顧自己學到了什麼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Read an older article ",
        "zh": "讀一篇舊文章，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and review a few saved words. ",
        "zh": "並複習幾個收藏的單字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some things may feel easier now. ",
        "zh": "有些內容現在可能感覺更容易。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Progress is not always a big change. ",
        "zh": "進步不一定都是巨大的改變。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Sometimes it means starting with less effort ",
        "zh": "有時，進步代表能更輕鬆地開始，"
      },
      {
        "en": "and feeling ready to learn again tomorrow.",
        "zh": "也覺得自己準備好明天再學一次。"
      }
    ]
  ],
